#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/xsoft/office/libreoffice.xml:309
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"There are many optional dependencies not listed here. They can be found in "
"the <filename>download.lst</filename> file in the sources directory."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/xsoft/office/libreoffice.xml:315
#, xml-text
msgid "Editor Notes: <ulink url=\"&blfs-wiki;/libreoffice\"/>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/xsoft/office/libreoffice.xml:320
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of LibreOffice"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/xsoft/office/libreoffice.xml:336
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"First, fix a problem with detecting Boost::System, which was changed from a "
"library to a series of headers in Boost-1.89.0:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/xsoft/office/libreoffice.xml:340
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput remap=\"pre\">export boost_cv_lib_system=yes</userinput>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/xsoft/office/libreoffice.xml:343
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Next, fix a bug with linking to zlib, fix a bug which would cause an install"
" failure, and prevent compression of man pages:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/xsoft/office/libreoffice.xml:348
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">sed -i '/icuuc \\\\/a zlib\\\\'           writerperfect/Library_wpftdraw.mk &amp;&amp;\n"
"sed -i \"/distro-install-file-lists/d\" Makefile.in                       &amp;&amp;\n"
"sed -e \"/gzip -f/d\"   \\\n"
"    -e \"s|.1.gz|.1|g\" \\\n"
"    -i bin/distro-install-desktop-integration</userinput>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/xsoft/office/libreoffice.xml:355
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have downloaded the dictionaries, help and translations tarballs, "
"create symlinks to them from the source directory so they won't get "
"downloaded again:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/xsoft/office/libreoffice.xml:360
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -dm755 external/tarballs &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -sv ../../../libreoffice-dictionaries-&libreoffice-dlversion;.tar.xz external/tarballs/ &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -sv ../../../libreoffice-help-&libreoffice-dlversion;.tar.xz         external/tarballs/ &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -sv ../../../libreoffice-translations-&libreoffice-dlversion;.tar.xz external/tarballs/</userinput>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/xsoft/office/libreoffice.xml:366
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The instructions in the package unpack some tarballs into a location it "
"cannot find later.  Create some symlinks to help the build system out:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/xsoft/office/libreoffice.xml:370
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>ln -sv src/libreoffice-help-&libreoffice-dlversion;/helpcontent2/ &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -sv src/libreoffice-dictionaries-&libreoffice-dlversion;/dictionaries/ &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -sv src/libreoffice-translations-&libreoffice-dlversion;/translations/</userinput>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/xsoft/office/libreoffice.xml:376
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"During the build process, some packages will be downloaded (including the "
"ones listed as recommended and optional dependencies) if they are not "
"present on the system. Because of this, build time may vary from the "
"published time more than usual."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/xsoft/office/libreoffice.xml:384
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Due to the large size of the package, you may prefer to install it in "
"<filename class=\"directory\">/opt</filename>, instead of <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr</filename>. Depending on your choice, replace "
"<replaceable>&lt;PREFIX&gt;</replaceable> by <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr</filename> or by <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/opt/libreoffice-&libreoffice-dlversion;</filename>:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/xsoft/office/libreoffice.xml:392
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>export "
"LO_PREFIX=<replaceable>&lt;PREFIX&gt;</replaceable></userinput>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/xsoft/office/libreoffice.xml:395
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Locales \"fr\" and \"en-GB\", you will find below, are just examples; you "
"should change them to suit your needs - you might want to read the \"Command"
" Explanations\", further below, before proceeding."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/xsoft/office/libreoffice.xml:402
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you set the ACLOCAL environment variable to support installing Xorg in "
"/opt, you will need to unset it for this package."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/xsoft/office/libreoffice.xml:408
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you are building on a 32 bit machine, <envar>CFLAGS</envar> is set to "
"<command>-Os</command>, which breaks the build. Prevent this by issuing:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/xsoft/office/libreoffice.xml:413
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>case $(uname -m) in\n"
"   i?86) sed /-Os/d -i solenv/gbuild/platform/LINUX_INTEL_GCC.mk ;;\n"
"esac</userinput>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/xsoft/office/libreoffice.xml:418
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Prepare <application>LibreOffice</application> for compilation by running "
"the following commands:"
